ImportView ..> TripItemsController : submits preview then confirmation
TripItemsController ..> Trip : imports into
Trip --> TripItem : has many
TripItemsController ..> TripItem : checks duplicates and creates ideas
TripItem ..> Geocodable : includes concern
TripItemsController ..> GeocodeTripItemsJob : enqueues missing coordinate IDs
GeocodeTripItemsJob ..> TripItem : invokes geocode operation
